Jira ID - DT-3207 - Sierra Wireless not detected at bootup in lsusb 3-4 minute delay causing connectivity loss ;
Jira ID - BGR3-1369 - Err,Sierra modem not detected and Hence usb ports are also not detected

Description :

Copying the latest libft4222.so.1.4.4.232 to /lib/ and linking it as libft4222.so

md5sum libft4222.so.1.4.4.232
cc0f792e1ad002a8d04ee3eb4b3a4ae3 libft4222.so.1.4.4.232

This file, expander_init, should be copied to /bin/vendor/  with permissions set to 755.
MD5SUM: 690fa2624faa9c895dd9df61ae1fab89

The expander_init module depends on the library libft4222.so.1.4.4.232. If this library is missing, it causes issues, resulting in the Sierra modem not being detected.

